  "description": "All YITAMOTOR products have one thing in common – they offer the best possible performance and dependability.\nYou get a great upgraded towing mirror that meets the same standards set for factory mirrors and they mount in the same location for easy installation.\nWith strict quality control standards, the replacement mirrors are steady and have no vibration even at highway speeds when driving.\nProvide a better and wider angle of rear view, which improves visibility and reduces blind spots to ensure the safety of drivers and passengers.\nEnhance the Style of the Vehicle and make your vehicle stand out on the road.\nFitment\nfor 2014-2018 Chevrolet Silverado 1500\nfor 2014-2018 GMC Sierra 1500\nfor 2015-2019 Chevrolet Silverado 2500HD 3500 HD\nfor 2015-2019 GMC Sierra 2500 HD 3500 HD\nfor 2019 Chevrolet Silverado 1500 Legacy\nfor 2019 GMC Sierra 1500 Limited\nDo not fit for 2014 Silverado/ Sierra 2500 HD 3500 HD\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nFitment: compatible with 2014 2015 2016 2017 2018 Silverado Sierra 1500, 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 Silverado Sierra 2500 HD 3500 HD\nPackage contents & dimensions: a pair of telescoping trailer tow mirrors, including driver side and passenger side; side mirror length is 18” (closed) and 20.8” (extended); side mirror size is 12”×8.8”\nFunctions: featuring power adjustable plane mirror, manually adjustable convex lens, manual telescoping & manual folding, helping you keep a watchful eye on your surroundings\nEasy to install: just simply connect the plugs of the trailer towing mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications are required（professional installation would be highly recommended）\nNote: Please check if your vehicle has the same functions as that of towing mirrors, such as turn signal, otherwise some functions of towing mirrors will be disabled when the vehicle does not possess the corresponding functions",
